== Section 1 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section1>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
<blockquote>I am Alkabar, here is out stone.<br>
We place it here in the hours before dawn, to mark out march beyond the desert we know, into the desert we don't.</blockquote>
<blockquote>With me are the strongest, the worst of men. They know no other meaning than the fight. If it must be a fight, then it must.</blockquote>
<blockquote>
May the fight bring eternal glory if<br>
we are gods,<br>
and eternal shame if we are not.
</blockquote>
</div>
